OL,3,ACut National Insurance for under-25s to
OL,4,Acreate jobs, Milburn report to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo help create more jobs for younger
OL,7,Fpeople, national Insurance (NI) paid by
OL,8,Fbusinesses on workers aged under 25
OL,9,Fshould be gradually lowered, a major
OL,10,Freview of youth unemployment will say.
OL,12,FStarting in retail and hospitality, the
OL,13,Fgovernment should reduce NI costs over
OL,14,Ffive years for people aged between 21
OL,15,Fand 24 years old, the report by former
OL,16,FLabour minister Alan Milburn suggests.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
